- telemetry
- status
- replay
- duplicate
- unknown_origin

must be rejected.

UNKNOWN MUST FAIL CLOSED.

Layer 5 — Recursion protection

One received WhatsApp event must never indirectly produce another CLI submission unless another distinct human inbound WhatsApp message exists.

